{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6556805827450074321,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Derivations",
      "source_hash": 7624194656699682091,
      "context_hash": 9493834289623194070,
      "translation": "Derivation",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivations": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159913Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Build instructions for Nix [packages](/concepts/packages) expressed using the [Nix language](/concepts/nix-language)",
      "source_hash": 14031751062767389619,
      "context_hash": 6881088953126437374,
      "translation": "[Nix 언어](/concepts/nix-language)로 표현된 Nix [패키지](/concepts/packages) 빌드 명령",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "Nix language": "Nix 언어",
        "packages": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159914Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A _derivation_ is an instruction that Nix uses to [_realise_][realisation] a Nix package.",
      "source_hash": 10968780651427897267,
      "context_hash": 7387924741208430746,
      "translation": "*derivation*은 Nix가 Nix 패키지를 [*실체화*][realisation]하는 데 사용하는 명령어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "realisation": "실체화",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "package": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:42:26.364982Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "They're created using a special `derivation` function in the [Nix language](#nix-language).",
      "source_hash": 4302280134355675051,
      "context_hash": 10994958393400263168,
      "translation": "derivation은 [Nix 언어](#nix-language)의 특별한 `derivation` 함수를 사용해 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix language": "Nix 언어",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "They can depend on any number of other derivations and produce one or more final [outputs](#outputs).",
      "source_hash": 4278830222658398484,
      "context_hash": 18433044749001141587,
      "translation": "derivation은 다른 derivation에 얼마든지 의존할 수 있으며, 하나 이상의 최종 [출력](#outputs)을 만들어냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "outputs": "출력",
        "derivations": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "A derivation and all of the dependencies required to build it&mdash;direct dependencies, and all dependencies of those dependencies, etc&mdash;is called a [closure].",
      "source_hash": 8800643600020270098,
      "context_hash": 2219827531279039854,
      "translation": "derivation과 그것을 빌드하는 데 필요한 모든 의존성&mdash;직접 의존성, 그리고 그 의존성들의 모든 의존성 등&mdash;을 [클로저][closure]라고 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dependencies": "의존성",
        "derivation": "derivation",
        "closure": "클로저"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Derivation outputs",
      "source_hash": 10694810635402607892,
      "context_hash": 13483998822015795623,
      "translation": "Derivation 출력",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivation": "derivation",
        "outputs": "출력"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The most common outputs:",
      "source_hash": 8460776140037722777,
      "context_hash": 3775113348641907152,
      "translation": "가장 흔한 출력:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "outputs": "출력"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`out`, the most generic one",
      "source_hash": 9652606907339753560,
      "context_hash": 8387872091273706624,
      "translation": "`out`, 가장 일반적인 출력",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`lib`, for library outputs",
      "source_hash": 3225018375462221818,
      "context_hash": 9161037688694703230,
      "translation": "`lib`, 라이브러리 출력용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "outputs": "출력"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`dev`, general development resources such as header files",
      "source_hash": 5869301776521161351,
      "context_hash": 15730123479802924272,
      "translation": "`dev`, 헤더 파일과 같은 일반적인 개발 리소스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`man`, for manual pages",
      "source_hash": 6557118261291525895,
      "context_hash": 1013955785087655731,
      "translation": "`man`, 매뉴얼 페이지용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "A derivation and all of the dependencies required to build it&mdash;direct dependencies, and all dependencies of those dependencies, etc&mdash;is called a _package closure_.",
      "source_hash": 547991304502395914,
      "context_hash": 8023755045851127545,
      "translation": "derivation과 그것을 빌드하는 데 필요한 모든 의존성&mdash;직접 의존성, 그리고 그 의존성들의 모든 의존성 등&mdash;을 *패키지 클로저*라고 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivation": "derivation",
        "dependencies": "의존성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Mental model",
      "source_hash": 5173372465179824084,
      "context_hash": 15626434473991106348,
      "translation": "사고 모형",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "You may find it helpful to think of a derivation as the _plan_ or _blueprint_ for a Nix package.",
      "source_hash": 14594976363876873055,
      "context_hash": 1414358544941573058,
      "translation": "derivation을 Nix 패키지의 *계획*이나 *청사진*으로 생각하면 이해하는 데 도움이 될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivation": "derivation",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "package": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Derivations in the Nix language",
      "source_hash": 8987040283189473376,
      "context_hash": 5814637759962111991,
      "translation": "Nix 언어에서의 derivation",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix language": "Nix 언어",
        "derivations": "derivation",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "In the [Nix language][lang], derivations are created using the [`derivation`][func] function.",
      "source_hash": 12427167550307421261,
      "context_hash": 2876581766576984492,
      "translation": "[Nix 언어][lang]에서 derivation은 [`derivation`][func] 함수를 사용해 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivations": "derivation",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "Nix language": "Nix 언어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Here's the type signature for `derivation` expressed as a [Haskell]-ish signature:[^1]",
      "source_hash": 11294233282018046919,
      "context_hash": 14654530301277432229,
      "translation": "다음은 [Haskell] 스타일 시그니처로 표현한 `derivation`의 타입 시그니처입니다:[^1]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Here's an example derivation:",
      "source_hash": 2015928146729966057,
      "context_hash": 3436205764098748036,
      "translation": "다음은 derivation의 예시입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivation": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "And that's it!",
      "source_hash": 4002656703130945605,
      "context_hash": 15112426323792361687,
      "translation": "그것으로 끝입니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "The `derivation` function takes only these arguments.",
      "source_hash": 15224970562637746586,
      "context_hash": 15854441967471837163,
      "translation": "`derivation` 함수는 이 인자들만 받습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "But derivations can be far less straightforward, because the scripting logic that you pass via `args` can be arbitrarily complex.",
      "source_hash": 17908720976754449275,
      "context_hash": 7190843999833763775,
      "translation": "하지만 `args`를 통해 전달하는 스크립팅 로직이 임의로 복잡해질 수 있으므로, derivation은 훨씬 덜 단순해질 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivations": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "String interpolation",
      "source_hash": 10235432687792781065,
      "context_hash": 1686046947116028664,
      "translation": "문자열 보간",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "If Nix sees this string...",
      "source_hash": 2912954077034872426,
      "context_hash": 8412959074782028112,
      "translation": "Nix가 이 문자열을 보면...",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "The string output of a derivation is always a [Nix store path][store]",
      "source_hash": 4933178327848971439,
      "context_hash": 13019469989293366577,
      "translation": "derivation의 문자열 출력은 항상 [Nix 스토어 경로][store]입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix store": "Nix 스토어",
        "Nix store path": "Nix 스토어 경로",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "output": "출력",
        "store path": "스토어 경로",
        "derivation": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Derivation outputs",
      "source_hash": 10694810635402607892,
      "context_hash": 1441443321054500613,
      "translation": "Derivation 출력",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "outputs": "출력",
        "derivation": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Realisation",
      "source_hash": 6714743551814915179,
      "context_hash": 7815698043216184783,
      "translation": "실체화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "realisation": "실체화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:42:26.364984Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Special variables",
      "source_hash": 13492729198877552351,
      "context_hash": 8657369357892793772,
      "translation": "특별 변수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "There are two special variables to be aware of when writing derivations:",
      "source_hash": 3314213301669235926,
      "context_hash": 4768828582208879834,
      "translation": "derivation을 작성할 때 알아둬야 할 두 가지 특별 변수가 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivations": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`$out` represents the root of the directory structure for build output.",
      "source_hash": 1361651174131513905,
      "context_hash": 14114344183362848799,
      "translation": "`$out`은 빌드 출력을 위한 디렉터리 구조의 루트를 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "output": "출력"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`$src` represents the build sources.",
      "source_hash": 8000892400031336836,
      "context_hash": 16768689090166461464,
      "translation": "`$src`는 빌드 소스를 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The standard environment",
      "source_hash": 9139599634067377158,
      "context_hash": 11145360621923015429,
      "translation": "표준 환경",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "standard environment": "표준 환경"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:56:22.159919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Most derivations in the Nix ecosystem are based on the [`mkDerivation`][mk] function from the [standard environment][stdenv].",
      "source_hash": 12070146090472816335,
      "context_hash": 11171430386370358638,
      "translation": "Nix 생태계의 대부분의 derivation은 [표준 환경][stdenv]의 [`mkDerivation`][mk] 함수를 기반으로 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "stdenv": "stdenv",
        "derivations": "derivation",
        "standard environment": "표준 환경"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "While you _can_ create derivations using the raw `derivation` function, it's far more common to use a wrapper function around it.",
      "source_hash": 4236262660979503580,
      "context_hash": 7893091872369858603,
      "translation": "원시 `derivation` 함수를 사용해 derivation을 만들 *수*는 있지만, 이를 감싸는 래퍼 함수를 사용하는 것이 훨씬 더 일반적입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivations": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281153Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Perhaps the most commonly used wrapper function is [`stdenv.mkDerivation`][mk].",
      "source_hash": 11812438872337329576,
      "context_hash": 8983581393872908255,
      "translation": "아마도 가장 흔히 사용되는 래퍼 함수는 [`stdenv.mkDerivation`][mk]일 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281155Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Arguments:",
      "source_hash": 18004528280962014016,
      "context_hash": 11272454513014089148,
      "translation": "인자:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The `name` of the package.",
      "source_hash": 9090526831543243623,
      "context_hash": 12514098382309109349,
      "translation": "패키지의 `name`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "package": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "If you specify `pname` and `version` instead, the `name` ends up `${pname}-${version}`.",
      "source_hash": 17816194509257261915,
      "context_hash": 13560401793718240547,
      "translation": "대신 `pname`과 `version`을 지정하면, `name`은 결국 `${pname}-${version}`이 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281157Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Other derivation functions",
      "source_hash": 888359556401116543,
      "context_hash": 4252936303304724447,
      "translation": "그 밖의 derivation 함수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivation": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281157Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Outside of `stdenv.mkDerivation`, there are many custom derivation wrappers for specific languages, frameworks, and more (and many of those actually wrap `stdenv.mkDerivation`).",
      "source_hash": 10407273177758144965,
      "context_hash": 892925545839527041,
      "translation": "`stdenv.mkDerivation` 외에도 특정 언어, 프레임워크 등을 위한 다양한 커스텀 derivation 래퍼가 존재합니다(그리고 그중 상당수는 실제로 `stdenv.mkDerivation`을 감싸고 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "derivation": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Some examples:",
      "source_hash": 13116419464886084737,
      "context_hash": 977736615464014732,
      "translation": "몇 가지 예시:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281159Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[`buildGoModule`][buildgomodule] for [Go]",
      "source_hash": 10419209558970396246,
      "context_hash": 527611751951799772,
      "translation": "[Go]를 위한 [`buildGoModule`][buildgomodule]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281159Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[`buildRustPackage`][buildrustpackage] for [Rust]",
