      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:49.281161Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "And you're always free to create your own derivation functions and even wrap helper functions like `buildPythonApplication`.",
      "source_hash": 5533832886272474719,
      "context_hash": 259969770471398929,
      "translation": "그리고 여러분은 언제든 자신만의 derivation 함수를 만들 수 있으며, `buildPythonApplication`과 같은 헬퍼 함수를 감쌀 수도 있습니다.",
